 for a more polished look\n       \nNew: A soft glass material responds to surrounding colors and automatically adjusts its transparency for a more refined look\nNew: Soft glass lighting effects respond dynamically to your actions for more fluid interactions\nNew: The Lock screen offers more clock customization options, including text width and height, position, font, and material style\nNew: Notifications can appear in stacks on the Lock screen and at the bottom of the Notification shade for easier access and smoother animations\nNew: The Home screen supports widget stacks. Swipe up or down to switch between widgets, with multiple shapes and styles available for a clearer view of information.\nNew: You can resize Home screen folders by dragging "},{"cn":"hongkong","rg":"China","br":"Stable","m":"Fastboot","v":"OS4.0.6.0.XFRCNXM","an":"17.0","d":"2026-09-17","sz":"15.0 GB","md5":"1bb94dcf3b01d085c7a56feb4a772b11","u":"https://bkt-sgp-miui-ota-update-alisgp.oss-ap-southeast-1.aliyuncs.com/OS4.0.6.0.XFRCNXM/hongkong_images_OS4.0.6.0.XFRCNXM_20260917.0000.00_17.0_cn_1bb94dcf3b.tgz"}]}